          "value_raw": "As per minor perilous demesne (see below), except this can involve up to four hazards, each of CR 6 or less, imperil creatures in the area. If any hazards are encountered together, the encounter’s effective CR from hazards must be no more than 7 (for instance, two CR 5 hazards could be encountered together).",
