  "description": {
    "raw": "By touching the ground, you curse the land with four unnatural hazards. This functions as lesser curse terrain, but with the effects of the major perilous demesne curse (see page 145).Perilous Demesne, MajorType regional curse; Area 1-mile-radius emanation; Save Will DC 16 to remove\n\nEffect As per minor perilous demesne (see below), except this can involve up to four hazards, each of CR 6 or less, imperil creatures in the area. If any hazards are encountered together, the encounter’s effective CR from hazards must be no more than 7 (for instance, two CR 5 hazards could be encountered together).",
    "search_text": "\"by touching the ground, you curse the land with four unnatural hazards. this functions as lesser curse terrain, but with the effects of the major perilous demesne curse (see page 145).perilous demesne, majortype regional curse; area 1-mile-radius emanation; save will dc 16 to remove\\n\\neffect as per minor perilous demesne (see below), except this can involve up to four hazards, each of cr 6 or less, imperil creatures in the area. if any hazards are encountered together, the encounter’s effective cr from hazards must be no more than 7 (for instance, two cr 5 hazards could be encountered together).\"",
